{"sha": "adaf20149cd0bde9a7d58847eec41f8d5dac038113c0bfce4186735ebb71cb5f", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:poly} 章 --- 多项式}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:poly:1}", "$X^5 - 1 = (X^2 + X + 1)(X^3 - X^2 + 1) + (-X - 2)$。步骤：减去", "$X^3 B$，再减去 $-X^2 B$，最后减去 $B$；余式 $-X - 2$ 的次数为", "$1 < 2$。\\emph{在 $X = 1$ 时验算：}$\\;0 = 3 \\times 1 + (-3)$。", "", "$2X^4 + X^3 - X + 3 = (X^2 - 2)(2X^2 + X + 4) + (X + 11)$。\\emph{在", "$X = 0$ 处验算：} $\\;3 = (-2)(4) + 11$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:poly:2}", "$X^2 + X + 1 = (X - j)(X - j^2)$，其中 $j = \\eu^{2\\iu\\pi/3}$，$j^3 =", "1$。它整除 $Q_n = X^{2n} + X^n + 1$，当且仅当 $j$ 与 $j^2$ 都是", "$Q_n$ 的根；因 $Q_n$ 的系数为实数，$Q_n(j^2) =", "\\conj{Q_n(j)}$，故只需 $Q_n(j) = 0$。现 $Q_n(j) =", "j^{2n} + j^n + 1$ 取决于 $n$ 模 $3$ 的余数：", "\\begin{itemize}", "  \\item $n \\equiv 0$: $Q_n(j) = 1 + 1 + 1 = 3 \\neq 0$;", "  \\item $n \\equiv 1$: $Q_n(j) = j^2 + j + 1 = 0$;", "  \\item $n \\equiv 2$: $Q_n(j) = j^4 + j^2 + 1 = j + j^2 + 1 = 0$.", "\\end{itemize}", "于是 $X^2 + X + 1 \\mid X^{2n} + X^n + 1$ 当且仅当 $3 \\nmid n$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:poly:3}", "由\\cref{prop:b1:poly:multiplicity}可知，$(X-1)^2 \\mid P$ 当且仅当 $P(1) =", "P'(1) = 0$：", "\\[", "P(1) = 2 + a + b = 0, \\qquad P'(1) = 4 + 3a + 2b = 0 .", "\\]", "解得 $b = -a - 2$，并代入得 $4 + 3a - 2a - 4 = a = 0$，故 $a = 0$，$b =", "-2$，于是 $P = X^4 - 2X^2 + 1 = (X^2 - 1)^2 = (X-1)^2 (X+1)^2$，这是", "实数范围内的因式分解。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:poly:4}", "$X^3 - 1 = (X - 1)(X - j)(X - j^2)$ 在 $\\C$ 上成立（$j = \\eu^{2\\iu\\pi/3}$），", "而 $(X - 1)(X^2 + X + 1)$ 是在 $\\R$ 上的分解。", "", "$X^4 + X^2 + 1 = (X^2 + X + 1)(X^2 - X + 1)$ 在 $\\R$ 上成立（展开即可，", "或注意 $X^4 + X^2 + 1 = (X^2+1)^2 - X^2$）；在 $\\C$ 上，每个二次式", "都可分解：根为 $j, j^2$ 与 $-j, -j^2$，即 $\\eu^{\\pm 2\\iu\\pi/3},", "\\eu^{\\pm\\iu\\pi/3}$。", "", "$X^6 - 1 = \\prod_{k=0}^{5} (X - \\eu^{\\iu k\\pi/3})$ 在 $\\C$ 上成立，而在", "$\\R$ 上：", "\\[", "X^6 - 1 = (X-1)(X+1)(X^2 + X + 1)(X^2 - X + 1),", "\\]", "将共轭对 $\\eu^{\\pm 2\\iu\\pi/3}$ 与 $\\eu^{\\pm", "\\iu\\pi/3}$ 分组合并。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:poly:5}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 设 $p/q$（既约分数）为首一整系数多项式", "        $X^3 + \\dots + c_0$ 的根：", "        $P(p/q) = 0$ 中去分母，得 $p^3 = -q\\,(\\text{整数})$，故 $q \\mid", "        p^3$；由互素性得 $q = \\pm 1$：此根为整数", "        $p$，且 $p \\mid c_0$（把 $c_0$ 单独移到一边）。本题中候选根为", "        $6$ 的因数：逐一检验，$P(1) = 0$，$P(2) = 0$，$P(3) = 0$。于是", "        $P = (X-1)(X-2)(X-3)$。", "  \\item 由韦达定理：$s_1 = 6$，$s_2 = 11$，$s_3 = 6$。平方和：", "        $s_1^2 - 2s_2 = 36 - 22 = 14 = 1 + 4 + 9$，与预期相符。倒数之和：", "        $\\frac{s_2}{s_3} = \\frac{11}{6} = 1 + \\frac12 + \\frac13$，与预期相符。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:poly:6}", "欧几里得算法的第一步除法：", "\\[", "(X + 1)(X^3 - X^2 + X - 1)", "= X^4 - X^3 + X^2 - X + X^3 - X^2 + X - 1 = X^4 - 1 ,", "\\]", "于是 $X^4 - 1$ 除以 $X^3 - X^2 + X - 1$ 恰好除尽", "（商为 $X + 1$，余式为 $0$），算法立即停止：", "\\[", "\\gcd(X^4 - 1,\\; X^3 - X^2 + X - 1) = X^3 - X^2 + X - 1", "\\]", "（已为首一）。贝祖等式是平凡的：$\\gcd = 0", "\\cdot (X^4 - 1) + 1 \\cdot (X^3 - X^2 + X - 1)$。以因式分解作一致性检验：", "$X^3 - X^2 + X - 1 = (X - 1)(X^2 + 1)$，它确实是", "$X^4 - 1 =", "(X-1)(X+1)(X^2+1)$ 的公共不可约因式之积。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:poly:7}", "由于 $P \\geq 0$ 在 $\\R$ 上成立，其实根的重数均为偶数（在", "奇数重根处 $P$ 变号）。利用", "\\cref{cor:b1:poly:factorization} 并两两配对，写作", "\\[", "P = c \\prod_i (X - a_i)^{2k_i} \\prod_j \\bigl((X - z_j)(X - \\conj", "z_j)\\bigr)^{n_j},", "\\]", "其中 $c > 0$（由 $+\\infty$ 处的性态）。令", "\\[", "S = \\sqrt c\\, \\prod_i (X - a_i)^{k_i} \\prod_j (X - z_j)^{n_j}", "\\in \\C[X],", "\\]", "从而 $P = S\\,\\conj S$，其中 $\\conj S$ 的系数", "多项式。将 $S = A + \\iu B$（其中 $A, B \\in \\R[X]$），则", "\\[", "P = (A + \\iu B)(A - \\iu B) = A^2 + B^2 .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:poly:8}", "由拉格朗日插值公式（\\cref{thm:b1:poly:lagrange}），取节点 $0, 1, 2$：", "\\[", "P = 1\\cdot\\frac{(X-1)(X-2)}{(0-1)(0-2)} + 3\\cdot\\frac{X(X-2)}{1\\cdot(1-2)}", "+ 2\\cdot\\frac{X(X-1)}{2\\cdot 1}", "= \\frac{(X-1)(X-2)}{2} - 3X(X-2) + X(X-1).", "\\]", "展开得 $\\frac{X^2 - 3X + 2}{2} - 3X^2 + 6X + X^2 - X =", "-\\frac{3}{2}X^2 + \\frac{7}{2}X + 1$.", ""]}